From: Sean Chatman <136349053+seanchatmangpt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:27:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] test(r2-preflight): r_projection_test skips when the
 fleet validator is absent (probe only; R1-X-PIN owns)

The sibling guard of xaas_stop_court_test.exs: without
~/.claude/dfcm/validate_receipt.py every R projection test fails with
python3 exit 2. Included on this pre-flight branch only so the CI test court
can proceed past it; R1-X-PIN owns the admitted repair.
CI-like env: 0 tests, 8 skipped. Host env: 8 passed.
---
 test/xaas/receipt/r_projection_test.exs | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/test/xaas/receipt/r_projection_test.exs b/test/xaas/receipt/r_projection_test.exs
index 6be352b..38429ad 100644
--- a/test/xaas/receipt/r_projection_test.exs
+++ b/test/xaas/receipt/r_projection_test.exs
@@ -17,6 +17,10 @@ defmodule Xaas.Receipt.RProjectionTest do
   @provider "zcode-r-projection"
   @validator Path.expand("~/.claude/dfcm/validate_receipt.py")
 
+  if not File.regular?(@validator) do
+    @moduletag skip: "needs ~/.claude/dfcm/validate_receipt.py (the fleet R-schema validator)"
+  end
+
   @acc "https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#r-projection-acceptance"
   @court "https://ggen-igniter.dev/ontology/semantic-jira#r-projection-court"
 
